{"logId": "92e44d5d-27ab-40f8-a87b-93bef47294e3", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [841, 135, 1083, 252], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[841.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 252.0], [841.0, 252.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "于东来把钱看透了，为此，他坚定地要求自己“要做财富的主人，不做财富的奴隶”。他明白，尽管自己是老总，但自己一人无论如何也撑不起这个企业，赚不来那么多利润。如果自己财迷心窍，以老总居功，把赚来的钱更多地聚进自己的腰包，员工们看到干得再好，赚得再多都是老总的，那谁还乐意再用心干呢？谁还愿意再跟着老总干呢？反之，如果想到财富是大家共同辛劳创造的，把财富公平合理地分给大家共同享受，乍一看，“财散”了，但员工的心聚得更齐了，更乐意跟着老总干了，创造的新财富也随之更多了。这样，胖东来在收益分配方面不就进入了一个“财散”——“人聚”——“财更聚”的良性循环了吗？整个企业不就聚成了一个有难同担，有福共享，心相印，情相融的同心同德的集体了吗？", "block_bbox": [197, 228, 979, 536], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 228.0], [979.0, 228.0], [979.0, 536.0], [197.0, 536.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "“四舍五入”与“九舍十入”\n读《东来致顾客的一封信》随想之四", "block_bbox": [239, 576, 639, 644], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 576.0], [639.0, 576.0], [639.0, 644.0], [239.0, 644.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "到市场购物算账，总会有零头出现。怎么处理这零头？于东来的回答是：“我们的收银员不懂得‘四舍五入’，只知道‘甩零’和‘九舍十八’。”这回答多么干脆又多么大方啊！", "block_bbox": [198, 682, 688, 813], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 682.0], [688.0, 682.0], [688.0, 813.0], [198.0, 813.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "“四舍五入”是小学生都懂得的数学运算法则，要说购物结账时“四舍五入”也未尝不可，谁也没有话说，因为这是众所周知的常识。", "block_bbox": [198, 821, 686, 918], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 821.0], [686.0, 821.0], [686.0, 918.0], [198.0, 918.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "可是，胖东来人结账时没有按“四舍五入”这一数学运算法则办事，而是采用了另外一个新的“规则”——“九舍十入”。显然，这是一个心理学规则，书本", "block_bbox": [198, 925, 684, 1022], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 925.0], [684.0, 925.0], [684.0, 1022.0], [198.0, 1022.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [694, 590, 975, 1014], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[694.0, 590.0], [975.0, 590.0], [975.0, 1014.0], [694.0, 1014.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1000, 604, 1137, 726], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[1000.0, 604.0], [1137.0, 604.0], [1137.0, 726.0], [1000.0, 726.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "显然，用“九舍十八”取代“四舍五入”法则，顾客与商场的感情更近了，顾客购物时的心情更畅快了。小小举动，莫大作用。这实在是一个创举，一大发明！", "block_bbox": [197, 1169, 976, 1232], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 1169.0], [976.0, 1169.0], [976.0, 1232.0], [197.0, 1232.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "上找不到，但却在顾客心里存在着。平心而论，当顾客结账时，如果是8.45元，按“四舍五入”收其8.5元，顾客嘴上不说，心里总不免觉得自己吃亏了；反之，当顾客该交8.49元时，按“九舍十八”，只收其8.4元，顾客就换成了另外一种心理——商场姿态高了，我受优待了。", "block_bbox": [197, 1030, 977, 1161], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 1030.0], [977.0, 1030.0], [977.0, 1161.0], [197.0, 1161.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.7652273178100586, "coordinate": [841, 135, 1083, 252], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[841.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 252.0], [841.0, 252.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9533530473709106, "coordinate": [197, 228, 979, 536], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 228.0], [979.0, 228.0], [979.0, 536.0], [197.0, 536.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.873877227306366, "coordinate": [239, 576, 639, 644], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 576.0], [639.0, 576.0], [639.0, 644.0], [239.0, 644.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9456133842468262, "coordinate": [198, 682, 688, 813], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 682.0], [688.0, 682.0], [688.0, 813.0], [198.0, 813.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9374610781669617, "coordinate": [198, 821, 686, 918], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 821.0], [686.0, 821.0], [686.0, 918.0], [198.0, 918.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9277398586273193, "coordinate": [198, 925, 684, 1022], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 925.0], [684.0, 925.0], [684.0, 1022.0], [198.0, 1022.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9331216812133789, "coordinate": [694, 590, 975, 1014], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[694.0, 590.0], [975.0, 590.0], [975.0, 1014.0], [694.0, 1014.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.45562610030174255, "coordinate": [1000, 604, 1137, 726], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1000.0, 604.0], [1137.0, 604.0], [1137.0, 726.0], [1000.0, 726.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9244758486747742, "coordinate": [197, 1169, 976, 1232], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 1169.0], [976.0, 1169.0], [976.0, 1232.0], [197.0, 1232.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9530301094055176, "coordinate": [197, 1030, 977, 1161], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 1030.0], [977.0, 1030.0], [977.0, 1161.0], [197.0, 1161.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "于东来把钱看透了，为此，他坚定地要求自己“要做财富的主人，不做财富的奴隶”。他明白，尽管自己是老总，但自己一人无论如何也撑不起这个企业，赚不来那么多利润。如果自己财迷心窍，以老总居功，把赚来的钱更多地聚进自己的腰包，员工们看到干得再好，赚得再多都是老总的，那谁还乐意再用心干呢？谁还愿意再跟着老总干呢？反之，如果想到财富是大家共同辛劳创造的，把财富公平合理地分给大家共同享受，乍一看，“财散”了，但员工的心聚得更齐了，更乐意跟着老总干了，创造的新财富也随之更多了。这样，胖东来在收益分配方面不就进入了一个“财散”——“人聚”——“财更聚”的良性循环了吗？整个企业不就聚成了一个有难同担，有福共享，心相印，情相融的同心同德的集体了吗？\n\n## “四舍五入”与“九舍十入” 读《东来致顾客的一封信》随想之四\n\n到市场购物算账，总会有零头出现。怎么处理这零头？于东来的回答是：“我们的收银员不懂得‘四舍五入’，只知道‘甩零’和‘九舍十八’。”这回答多么干脆又多么大方啊！\n\n“四舍五入”是小学生都懂得的数学运算法则，要说购物结账时“四舍五入”也未尝不可，谁也没有话说，因为这是众所周知的常识。\n\n可是，胖东来人结账时没有按“四舍五入”这一数学运算法则办事，而是采用了另外一个新的“规则”——“九舍十入”。显然，这是一个心理学规则，书本\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_694_590_975_1014.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"23%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_604_1137_726.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n\n\n显然，用“九舍十八”取代“四舍五入”法则，顾客与商场的感情更近了，顾客购物时的心情更畅快了。小小举动，莫大作用。这实在是一个创举，一大发明！\n\n上找不到，但却在顾客心里存在着。平心而论，当顾客结账时，如果是8.45元，按“四舍五入”收其8.5元，顾客嘴上不说，心里总不免觉得自己吃亏了；反之，当顾客该交8.49元时，按“九舍十八”，只收其8.4元，顾客就换成了另外一种心理——商场姿态高了，我受优待了。", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_841_135_1083_252.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//92e44d5d-27ab-40f8-a87b-93bef47294e3/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_841_135_1083_252.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A33%3A39Z%2F-1%2F%2F04ea8909fadfe99ab0a863989cdff2739b4a2f9ab5b4b602bb0c87f67e99545b", "imgs/img_in_image_box_694_590_975_1014.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//92e44d5d-27ab-40f8-a87b-93bef47294e3/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_694_590_975_1014.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A33%3A39Z%2F-1%2F%2F36c7e64edf86db2b9df285dad6728c56c48aae7ea47bfc296c70a75ff1992d55", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_604_1137_726.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//92e44d5d-27ab-40f8-a87b-93bef47294e3/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_604_1137_726.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A33%3A39Z%2F-1%2F%2F00abe4db81aded0f83e69c8edcf579610d9f99283c8e0678e913a59ffcb089e3"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//92e44d5d-27ab-40f8-a87b-93bef47294e3/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A33%3A39Z%2F-1%2F%2F1b01fd5a33f12f7c467427dc3f8d7cf581a1c75061e547ab801c62639d958792"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//92e44d5d-27ab-40f8-a87b-93bef47294e3/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A33%3A39Z%2F-1%2F%2Fac919d68eee7fdb5708b7316d0d7e03c4bb76a0ede8749daa78ed5aad84328c6"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//92e44d5d-27ab-40f8-a87b-93bef47294e3/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A33%3A39Z%2F-1%2F%2F949b07fccddd6d9d2dca77900c397f4e2cea8d7d64525dd8216f839899eef208"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
